{"seq":3,"slug":"group-buying-fraud-abuse-control","title":"拼团反作弊：刷团、羊毛党与虚假成团的识别与风控策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/social-group-buying-team-purchase-commerce-engineering/group-leader-virality-fraud-control/group-buying-fraud-abuse-control","wordCount":3067,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"拼团反作弊-刷团-羊毛党与虚假成团的识别与风控策略\">拼团反作弊：刷团、羊毛党与虚假成团的识别与风控策略</h1><p>拼团的成团倒计时是增长引擎，也是作弊者的作业窗口。只要有「成团即优惠」，就一定有人把成本压到最低去凑那个团：用自己控制的账号补位、用群控设备批量注册、用脚本在别人团里垫人头，或干脆注册一个空壳团长身份来自导自演。风控的对手不是一次点击，而是一条<strong>单位经济模型</strong>——作弊者算的是「补贴 − 账号成本 − 封号损失」是否为正，你算的是「拉新成本 vs 真实转化」。本文沿着这条经济线，拆开刷团、羊毛党、虚假成团三类攻击在拼团语境下的识别信号与决策架构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-作弊经济学与拼团攻击面\">核心概念：作弊经济学与拼团攻击面</h2><p>普通大促的作弊面是「一个人多领一张券」；拼团的作弊面是「一个人伪装成一群人」。差别来自两条设计约束：<strong>成团门槛是人数而非金额</strong>（因此「人头」本身成了稀缺资源，可以被租、被买、被批量伪造），以及<strong>优惠与团长收益绑定在人数上</strong>（因此刷团既是薅商品补贴，也是刷团长佣金）。三条收益路径相互叠加：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>作弊类型</th>\n<th>目标收益</th>\n<th>直接损失</th>\n<th>识别难点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>刷团 / 垫人头</td>\n<td>让差 1–2 人的团凑齐，保住优惠价</td>\n<td>商品差价 + 履约成本</td>\n<td>单账号看似正常，问题在团内关联</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>羊毛党（券套利）</td>\n<td>叠加新客券、首单立减、满减</td>\n<td>直接补贴流失</td>\n<td>首单即大额、地址/设备聚类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>虚假成团（自导自演）</td>\n<td>团长身份刷佣金 + 自购优惠</td>\n<td>佣金 + 商品补贴双重</td>\n<td>邀请边两端实为同一控制者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退款套利（跨境高发）</td>\n<td>收货后仅退款 / 退货调包</td>\n<td>货款 + 双向国际运费</td>\n<td>退货窗口长、举证成本高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>北美零售业协会（NRF）与 Appriss Retail 2023 年度报告估算，美国零售退货总额约 7430 亿美元、其中欺诈性退货约 1010 亿美元；该口径覆盖线下与线上，拼团场景因履约链路更长，套利窗口通常更宽。跨境电商还被 3D 验证（EMV 3-D Secure，3DS2）之后的<strong>拒付责任转移</strong>规则放大：一旦持卡人发起拒付且商户未能通过 3DS 举证，损失由商户承担（Visa/Mastercard 责任转移规则），因此风控必须在<strong>下单时刻</strong>而非拒付发生后拦截。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[下单/参团请求] --&gt; B[身份与设备层&lt;br/&gt;设备指纹·IP·行为]&#10;  A --&gt; C[关系层&lt;br/&gt;邀请边·同团成员关联图]&#10;  A --&gt; D[交易层&lt;br/&gt;金额·券叠加·历史履约]&#10;  B --&gt; E[实时特征聚合]&#10;  C --&gt; E&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F{决策引擎}&#10;  F --&gt;|低风险| G[放行]&#10;  F --&gt;|可疑| H[挑战&lt;br/&gt;滑块/短信/3DS2]&#10;  F --&gt;|高风险| I[拒绝或静默降级&lt;br/&gt;成团后不出货/冻结佣金]&#10;  H --&gt;|通过| G&#10;  H --&gt;|失败| I&#10;  G --&gt; J[成团结算]&#10;  I --&gt; K[名单回流·样本训练]&#10;  K --&gt; E\">flowchart TD\n  A[下单/参团请求] --&gt; B[身份与设备层&lt;br/&gt;设备指纹·IP·行为]\n  A --&gt; C[关系层&lt;br/&gt;邀请边·同团成员关联图]\n  A --&gt; D[交易层&lt;br/&gt;金额·券叠加·历史履约]\n  B --&gt; E[实时特征聚合]\n  C --&gt; E\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F{决策引擎}\n  F --&gt;|低风险| G[放行]\n  F --&gt;|可疑| H[挑战&lt;br/&gt;滑块/短信/3DS2]\n  F --&gt;|高风险| I[拒绝或静默降级&lt;br/&gt;成团后不出货/冻结佣金]\n  H --&gt;|通过| G\n  H --&gt;|失败| I\n  G --&gt; J[成团结算]\n  I --&gt; K[名单回流·样本训练]\n  K --&gt; E</pre><h2 id=\"刷团与虚假成团-从-单账号-转向-团伙\">刷团与虚假成团：从「单账号」转向「团伙」</h2><p>刷团的核心特征是<strong>参团成员之间不该有关联却有强关联</strong>。风控特征因此从账号维度上移到<strong>团队维度</strong>：对每个待成团的团，计算成员集合的关联密度。常用信号包括设备指纹重复（同 IMEI/IDFA/Android ID 或同 canvas/字体指纹）、IP 段或出口 ASN 聚集、注册时间同批次、收货地址与手机号号段聚集、成团动作时间间隔过小（脚本化）、以及「同一支付工具为多个不同账号付款」。</p>\n<p>一个可计算的形式化表达：把团 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 视为节点集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，对成员对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(i,j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 定义关联强度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，团内关联度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为归一化后的关联密度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mtext>dev</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>dev</mtext><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mtext>ip</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><msub><mtext>subnet</mtext><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mtext>pay</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>pay</mtext><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_g = \\frac{1}{\\binom{|M_g|}{2}} \\sum_{i&lt;j} w_{ij}, \\qquad\nw_{ij} = \\alpha \\cdot \\mathbb{1}[\\text{dev}_i=\\text{dev}_j] + \\beta \\cdot \\mathbb{1}[\\text{ip}_i \\in \\text{subnet}_j] + \\gamma \\cdot \\mathbb{1}[\\text{pay}_i=\\text{pay}_j]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7352em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.141em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.969em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.355em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.144em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vli